{
    "title": "Fantuan Delivery-\u996d\u56e2\u5916\u5356",
    "description": "The Best Asian Food Delivery! --- Fantuan delivery offers the largest selection of your favourite Asian restaurants and all other local favourite cuisines delivered to your door, anytime and anywhere.\r\n\r\n\u3010Fantuan Delivery & Pick-up \u3011\r\nBringing the taste of authentic Asian cuisines to your door. Browse from hundreds of local restaurants to traditional Asian restaurants in your city. Unsure of what to eat tonight? Let Fantuan help filter the restaurants you crave.\r\n\r\nPromotions: Enjoy new promotions everyday and coupon codes to help you save.\r\n\r\nSelf Pick-up: Order on our app and pick-up meals at restaurants. Eliminate wait times, and enjoy further savings. (Enjoy 10% OFF Pick-up orders, No delivery fees, No tips, No transaction fee.)\r\n\r\nExclusive Restaurants: Find restaurants exclusive to Fantuan\r\n\r\nRestaurants Partners include: Haidilao Hotpot, Coco bubble tea, Sharetea, Dinesty, Church\u2019s Chicken, Subway, Me+Crepe, Old Xian, and more. BBQ, hotpot, dumpling, dimsum, bubble tea, brunch, cake\u2026\r\n\r\n\u3010Additional Service\u3011\r\n\r\nFantuan Errands\r\nNeed to deliver a parcel and don\u2019t have the time to do it yourself? Or need to buy something from the supermarket but too lazy to leave the home? Fantuan Errands is here to help! We can help you to deliver or collect parcels from: important documents, keys, flowers, etc.. just name it. We are here to help!\r\n\r\nTT Mart\r\nYou can now order grocery and convenience store items on Fantuan! Unlimited selections of daily essentials, fresh produce, Asian popular snacks and more delivered to your door!\r\n\r\nMultiple Payment Methods\r\nvisa/master/ApplePay/Paypal/Vemo/Cash/Alipay/WechatPay\r\n\r\n\u3010About Fantuan\u3011\r\nFantuan was founded in Vancouver, Canada in 2014. With a mission of \"life made easier\", we are a technology company that provides a one-stop platform connecting people and their local community. Fantuan operates in major cities across Canada, the United States, Australia and the UK. As the world's leading life service platform, we enable our users to unlock access to the richness of their neighborhood and the city. From food and grocery delivery to convenience and daily deals, Fantuan is bringing communities closer together than ever before. Fantuan is also one of the Deloitte Canada Fast 50 companies.\r\n\r\n\u3010Contact\u3011\r\nBecome a merchant partner: https://merchant.fantuanorder.com/\r\nBecome a driver: https://delivery.fantuan.ca/#/registration\r\nFor order inquiry, please contact\r\nCanada: +1 7784022900\r\nUnited States: +1 2134591886\r\nAustralia: +61 370678999\r\nUnited Kingdom: +44 8000584061\r\nFor all other inquiries, please email: feedback@fantuan.ca",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Best Asian Food Delivery! --- Fantuan delivery offers the largest selection of your favourite Asian restaurants and all other local favourite cuisines delivered to your door, anytime and anywhere.<br><br>\u3010Fantuan Delivery &amp; Pick-up \u3011<br>Bringing the taste of authentic Asian cuisines to your door. Browse from hundreds of local restaurants to traditional Asian restaurants in your city. Unsure of what to eat tonight? Let Fantuan help filter the restaurants you crave.<br><br>Promotions: Enjoy new promotions everyday and coupon codes to help you save.<br><br>Self Pick-up: Order on our app and pick-up meals at restaurants. Eliminate wait times, and enjoy further savings. (Enjoy 10% OFF Pick-up orders, No delivery fees, No tips, No transaction fee.)<br><br>Exclusive Restaurants: Find restaurants exclusive to Fantuan<br><br>Restaurants Partners include: Haidilao Hotpot, Coco bubble tea, Sharetea, Dinesty, Church\u2019s Chicken, Subway, Me+Crepe, Old Xian, and more. BBQ, hotpot, dumpling, dimsum, bubble tea, brunch, cake\u2026<br><br>\u3010Additional Service\u3011<br><br>Fantuan Errands<br>Need to deliver a parcel and don\u2019t have the time to do it yourself? Or need to buy something from the supermarket but too lazy to leave the home? Fantuan Errands is here to help! We can help you to deliver or collect parcels from: important documents, keys, flowers, etc.. just name it. We are here to help!<br><br>TT Mart<br>You can now order grocery and convenience store items on Fantuan! Unlimited selections of daily essentials, fresh produce, Asian popular snacks and more delivered to your door!<br><br>Multiple Payment Methods<br>visa/master/ApplePay/Paypal/Vemo/Cash/Alipay/WechatPay<br><br>\u3010About Fantuan\u3011<br>Fantuan was founded in Vancouver, Canada in 2014. With a mission of &quot;life made easier&quot;, we are a technology company that provides a one-stop platform connecting people and their local community. Fantuan operates in major cities across Canada, the United States, Australia and the UK. As the world&#39;s leading life service platform, we enable our users to unlock access to the richness of their neighborhood and the city. From food and grocery delivery to convenience and daily deals, Fantuan is bringing communities closer together than ever before. Fantuan is also one of the Deloitte Canada Fast 50 companies.<br><br>\u3010Contact\u3011<br>Become a merchant partner: https://merchant.fantuanorder.com/<br>Become a driver: https://delivery.fantuan.ca/#/registration<br>For order inquiry, please contact<br>Canada: +1 7784022900<br>United States: +1 2134591886<br>Australia: +61 370678999<br>United Kingdom: +44 8000584061<br>For all other inquiries, please email: feedback@fantuan.ca",
